  "lyrics": [
    {
      "start": 51.33,
      "end": 55.16,
      "text": "We all came out to Montreux",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.16,
      "end": 60.02,
      "text": "On the Lake Geneva shoreline",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.02,
      "end": 64.23,
      "text": "To make records with a mobile",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.23,
      "end": 69.01,
      "text": "We didn't have much time",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.01,
      "end": 72.76,
      "text": "Frank Zappa and the Mothers",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.76,
      "end": 76.99,
      "text": "Were at the best place around",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.99,
      "end": 81.19,
      "text": "But some stupid with a flare gun",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.19,
      "end": 85.33,
      "text": "Burned the place to the ground",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.33,
      "end": 93.33,
      "text": "Smoke on the water, fire in the sky",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.95,
      "end": 101.95,
      "text": "Smoke on the water",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.8,
      "end": 119.42,
      "text": "They burned down the gambling house",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.42,
      "end": 123.77,
      "text": "It died with an awful sound",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.77,
      "end": 127.75,
      "text": "Funky & Claude was running in and out",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.75,
      "end": 132.44,
      "text": "Pulling kids out the ground",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.44,
      "end": 136.29,
      "text": "When it all was over",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.29,
      "end": 140.62,
      "text": "We had to find another place",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.62,
      "end": 144.54,
      "text": "But Swiss time was running out",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.54,
      "end": 148.73,
      "text": "It seemed that we would lose the race",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.73,
      "end": 156.73,
      "text": "Smoke on the water, fire in the sky",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.24,
      "end": 165.24,
      "text": "Smoke on the water",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 236.6,
      "end": 240.78,
      "text": "We ended up at the Grand Hotel",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 240.78,
      "end": 244.2,
      "text": "It was empty cold and bare",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 244.2,
      "end": 249.05,
      "text": "But with the Rolling truck Stones thing just outside",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 249.05,
      "end": 252.57,
      "text": "Making our music there",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 252.57,
      "end": 256.6,
      "text": "With a few red lights and a few old beds",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 256.6,
      "end": 261.57,
      "text": "We make a place to sweat",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 261.57,
      "end": 265.34,
      "text": "No matter what we get out of this",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 265.34,
      "end": 269.5,
      "text": "I know we'll never forget",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.5,
      "end": 277.5,
      "text": "Smoke on the water, fire in the sky",
      "source": "imported"
    },
    {
      "start": 277.96,
      "end": 282.96,
      "text": "Smoke on the water",
      "source": "imported"
    }
  ],
